name    mod-dungeon-challenge: dungeon factors, the weekly rotation and the Lightning Sphere / Entangling Roots affixes
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Mythic+ ideas 4, 5 and 6 (survey 2026-10-10), in Utgarde Keep
# (heroic) at level 28 (health x2.4 with the workbench's 5 % per level).
#   4. `.dchallenge scale 574 2 1 3 1` = trash health x2, boss health x3: a Dragonflayer Runecaster (23960, heroic
#      63000-65165) ends above 290000 (x4.8), Prince Keleseth (23953, 417056) above 2900000 (x7.2).
#   5. `.dchallenge week 3000` pins the rotation: the weekly pool 11-13 turns two a week, week 3000 = Lightning
#      Sphere + Entangling Roots. The run lists both; Enrage (13) is not this week.
#   6. `.dchallenge force` fires a run affix's next check: a Lightning Sphere (500100) appears next to a
#      participant, is scaled like trash (30240 x4.8 = 145152) and shocks bot a (no god mode); Entangling Roots
#      (57095) lands on the director from a mob near Keleseth.
timeout 240s

bot a warrior
group party

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
require a alive

log setup - factors and a pinned rotation week
as gm .dchallenge scale 574 2 1 3 1
expect output has "trash health 2.00"
as gm .dchallenge week 3000
expect output has "Lightning Sphere"
expect output has "Entangling Roots"
expect output lacks "Enrage"
as gm .dchallenge affixes 28
expect output has "Level 28: Call for Help, Speedy, Lightning Sphere, Entangling Roots"
as gm .dchallenge start 574 28
expect output has "starting"
waitfor gm map 574 timeout 20s
waitfor a map 574 timeout 20s
wait 2s

log 5 - the run carries the pinned week's affixes
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "level 28"
expect output has "Affixes (week 3000): Call for Help, Speedy, Lightning Sphere, Entangling Roots"
expect output has "trash health 2.00 damage 1.00 | boss health 3.00"

log 6a - a forced Lightning Sphere appears, is scaled and shocks the bot
as gm .cheat god on
mark before
as gm .dchallenge force 11
expect output has "Lightning Sphere fires"
wait 2s
pick sph creature:500100 near a
require sph exists
expect sph maxhealth > 140000
wait 4s
expect a health < mark:before
do gm target sph
as gm .die
waitfor sph dead timeout 5s

log 4 - boss and trash factors
do gm goto 183.0 199.0 40.9
wait 3s
pick kel creature:23953 near gm
require kel exists
expect kel maxhealth > 2900000
pick rc creature:23960 near gm
require rc exists
expect rc maxhealth > 290000
do gm target rc
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "boss no"
expect output has "health factor 4.80"
do gm target kel
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "boss yes"
expect output has "health factor 7.20"

log 6b - forced Entangling Roots: a mob near the director roots it
as gm .dchallenge force 12
waitfor gm aura 57095 timeout 5s

cleanup
as gm .cheat god off
as gm .dchallenge week 0
as gm .dchallenge reload
place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
